mstpd: Multiple Spanning Tree Protocol Daemon
=============================================

Version: 0.1.1
---------------------------------------------
- add showportparams command to show only specific params of a port
  - Ali Forouzan <forouzan_a@office.zharfpoyan.net>
- bridge-stp.in: support different versions of pidof
  - Alexandru Ardelean <ardeleanalex@gmail.com>
- mstpctl-utils-functions.sh: fix shellcheck warnings
  - Jonas Gorski <jonas.gorski@bisdn.de>
- fix printing error message in bridge_bpdu_rcv()
  - QAQguowang <39701514+QAQguowang@users.noreply.github.com>
- fix calculating costs for speeds > 65G
  - Jonas Gorski <jonas.gorski@bisdn.de>
