  - Tomas Kyzlink <tkyzlink@dtitech.cz>
- mstpd: allow persistent configuration files
  - Tomas Kyzlink <tkyzlink@dtitech.cz>
- netif_utils: Use harcoded speed if EOPNOTSUPP
  - Tomas Kyzlink <tkyzlink@dtitech.cz>
- use traditional priorities and add some checks
  - Tomas Kyzlink <tkyzlink@dtitech.cz>
- change bridge and interface configuration locations
  - Tomas Kyzlink <tkyzlink@dtitech.cz>
