  - Tomas Kyzlink <tkyzlink@dtitech.cz>
- vlan: rename some functions and variables for readibility
  - Tomas Kyzlink <tkyzlink@dtitech.cz>
- bridge_track: fdb vlan flush only dynamic entries and support for DSA switches
  - Jonas Gorski <jonas.gorski@gmail.com>
- ifupdown.sh.in: fix new shellcheck warnings
  - Jonas Gorski <jonas.gorski@gmail.com>
- expand vlan status tracking to bridges
  - Tomas Kyzlink <tkyzlink@dtitech.cz>
